# CR 704.5q with unequal numbers: "N +1/+1 and N -1/-1 counters are removed from it, where N is the smaller of the number
# of +1/+1 and -1/-1 counters on it." Shang-Chi and the Ten Rings gets three +1/+1 counters from the three cards Ancestral
# Recall draws (Requiting Hex, Ornithopter and an Island). Bot1 casts the Ornithopter and then the Hex at it, blighting 1:
# the -1/-1 counter goes on Shang-Chi, and the state-based action takes one of each away, leaving two +1/+1 counters and
# no -1/-1 counter - a 4/4.

